## Article 192. Tasks of consideration on merits

```catala
declaration scope Article192MeritsTasks:
  input merits content MeritsConsideration
  output meritsConsiderationComplete content YesNo

scope Article192MeritsTasks:
  label merits_default definition meritsConsiderationComplete equals No

  label merits_complete exception merits_default
  definition meritsConsiderationComplete under condition
    merits.allEvidenceExamined = Yes
    and merits.closingArgumentsCompleted = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 193. Deadlines for case consideration

```catala
declaration scope Article193MeritsDeadlines:
  input merits content MeritsConsideration
  output deadlineToStartDays content integer
  output deadlineToCompleteDays content integer

scope Article193MeritsDeadlines:
  label start_deadline definition deadlineToStartDays equals 60

  label complete_deadline definition deadlineToCompleteDays equals 30
```

## Article 194. Court hearing

```catala
declaration scope Article194CourtHearing:
  input hearing content HearingProceeding
  input allPartiesNotified content YesNo
  output hearingCanBeHeld content YesNo

scope Article194CourtHearing:
  label hearing_default definition hearingCanBeHeld equals No

  label hearing_ready exception hearing_default
  definition hearingCanBeHeld under condition
    hearing.presidingJudgeAssigned = Yes
    and allPartiesNotified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

