## Articles 203-205. Witnesses, expert testimony, evidence examination

```catala
declaration scope Article203Witnesses:
  input witnessPresent content YesNo
  input witnessSwornIn content YesNo
  output witnessCanTestify content YesNo

scope Article203Witnesses:
  label witness_default definition witnessCanTestify equals No

  label witness_ready exception witness_default
  definition witnessCanTestify under condition
    witnessPresent = Yes
    and witnessSwornIn = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 206. Consequences of non-appearance

```catala
declaration scope Article206NonAppearance:
  input hearing content HearingProceeding
  input plaintiffAbsent content YesNo
  input plaintiffProperlyNotified content YesNo
  input defendantAbsent content YesNo
  input defendantProperlyNotified content YesNo
  input witnessAbsent content YesNo
  input witnessProperlyNotified content YesNo
  input repeatedAbsence content YesNo
  output nonAppearanceConsequence content NonAppearanceConsequence

scope Article206NonAppearance:
  label consequence_default definition nonAppearanceConsequence equals NonAppearanceConsequence.ProceedingContinued

# Plaintiff absent after proper notification → case left without consideration
  label consequence_plaintiff_absent exception consequence_default
  definition nonAppearanceConsequence under condition
    plaintiffAbsent = Yes
    and plaintiffProperlyNotified = Yes
    consequence equals NonAppearanceConsequence.CaseLeftWithoutConsideration

# Defendant absent → proceeding continues
  label consequence_defendant_absent exception consequence_default
  definition nonAppearanceConsequence under condition
    defendantAbsent = Yes
    and defendantProperlyNotified = Yes
    consequence equals NonAppearanceConsequence.ProceedingContinued

# Witness absent → fine may be imposed
  label consequence_witness_absent exception consequence_default
  definition nonAppearanceConsequence under condition
    witnessAbsent = Yes
    and witnessProperlyNotified = Yes
    and repeatedAbsence = Yes
    consequence equals NonAppearanceConsequence.FineImposed

# Repeated witness absence → compulsory bring
  label consequence_witness_compulsory exception consequence_default
  definition nonAppearanceConsequence under condition
    witnessAbsent = Yes
    and repeatedAbsence = Yes
    consequence equals NonAppearanceConsequence.CompulsoryBring
```

