## Articles 212-215. Written and physical evidence examination

```catala
declaration scope Article212WrittenEvidence:
  input evidence content EvidenceItem
  input evidencePresentedToParties content YesNo
  output writtenEvidenceCanBeExamined content YesNo

scope Article212WrittenEvidence:
  label written_default definition writtenEvidenceCanBeExamined equals No

  label written_ready exception written_default
  definition writtenEvidenceCanBeExamined under condition
    evidencePresentedToParties = Yes
    and evidence.evidenceType = EvidenceType.DocumentaryEvidence
    consequence equals Yes
```

