## Articles 222-224. Closing arguments and deliberation

```catala
declaration scope Article222ClosingArguments:
  input merits content MeritsConsideration
  input plaintiffArgumentsCompleted content YesNo
  input defendantArgumentsCompleted content YesNo
  input thirdPartyArgumentsCompleted content YesNo
  output closingArgumentsComplete content YesNo

scope Article222ClosingArguments:
  label closing_default definition closingArgumentsComplete equals No

  label closing_complete exception closing_default
  definition closingArgumentsComplete under condition
    plaintiffArgumentsCompleted = Yes
    and defendantArgumentsCompleted = Yes
    and thirdPartyArgumentsCompleted = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
